rd/api/sql.c%2B%2B getDatabaseSize invokes SQLpage-count query, so getter is not zeroSQL. Current upstream source observation is not a pinned deployedworkerd binary proof.","recommendation":"Prefer authoritative known-ID membership check at the shared production namespace/activation boundary, covering public HTTP, site/application, hosted observations, internal fact/proof/birth/text/definition reads, direct service bindings and alarms; not five route-specific patches. Keep unknown target runtime inert with existing absent/unavailable results and no #first/#sent/operator/request/session/archive/maintenance initialization. Permit first creation only through existing verified creation/delivered-create proof and genesis judgment; initialize schema/sidecars and first entry/fold at actual genesis commit, with no premature known marking on rejected/unfit/rolled-back first input. Existing R1 prelookup gate remains outer admission and must not be weakened. Known IDs are existence, not incarnation/kind/authority proof: keep all current fullref/hash/source/read gates.","registry":"worker.mcpRoute588 chooses REGISTRIES by shape-parsed membership before cryptographic bound/authority. McpRegistry.#of642–649 constructs HostedRegistry; hosted.ts198–200 creates agents and ControlPlane120–123 createscontrol/control_budget and insertsbudget BEFORE HostedRegistry.create215 verifies binding/signature and238 observes authority. Minimal separate repair: make registry/control schema lazy and initialize only after existing bound, link/service/fullmembership validation and successful fresh authorityOf. Unknown membership must produce no ScopeObject SQL under shared gate and no Registry SQL. Do not treat a signed Control header as membership/genesis proof.","source":"Exact FULL954bf397 request read as builder. Current Main observed clean5e8476a1fb4b79aa8fb611b8848e3ecaaf42d8a1/treeded99c5aaa27554f1b4cfd169d0d6ffd954a58af. Read tracked source only plus expressly granted pinned workers-types5.20260815.1 and official Cloudflare primary docs/source. No mutable R1/S9/dependency changes, app/helper import, compiler/test/build/probe/install/deployment or credential access.","witnesses":"Cheapest meaningful Native set: fresh target IDs through each named ingress plus genuine authorized foreign-fact act, with storage/SQL instrumentation active BEFORE super/engine construction and no-after-the-fact-only table count; assert no targetexec/storagewrite/alarm/peer work where required. Real accepted register+child bootstrap and exactrepeat/restart preserve journal/fullref/alarms; malformed/forged firstproof and injected rollback leave no schema/knownmarker; interrupted index registration failsclosed and retries coherently. Hosted unknown-membership create with valid control/link envelope leaves both target andregistry untouched, with genuine known-membership success retained. Existing legacy-genesis migration witness and schema-only oldobject negative are necessary. Rawsql spy alone does not observe internalKV/getterSQL; name instrumentation limits."}}